.sp
Use regional seismic travel\-time tables for Pn and Sn.
.UNINDENT
.INDENT 0.0
.TP
.B iLoc.profile.$name.UseRSTTPgLg
Default: \fBtrue\fP
.sp
Type: \fIboolean\fP
.sp
Use regional seismic travel\-time tables for Pg and Lg.
.UNINDENT
.INDENT 0.0
.TP
.B iLoc.profile.$name.UseLocalTT
