Z (zetta = 10**21), E (exa = 10**18), P (peta = 10**15),
T (tera = 10**12), G (giga = 10**9), M (mega = 10**6),
k (kilo = 10**3),
m (milli = 10**\-3), µ (micro = 10**\-6), n (nano = 10**\-9),
p (pico = 10**\-12), f (femto = 10**\-15), a (atto = 10**\-18),
