\fBNOTE:\fP
.INDENT 0.0
.INDENT 3.5
\fBeventlist.highlight.*\fP
\fIConfigurable row colouring rules for the event list. Each named\fP
\fIrule defines a logical condition and the background/foreground\fP
\fIcolours to apply when the condition matches. The first matching\fP
\fIrule wins; rows that match no rule revert to the default style.\fP
**
\fICondition syntax: boolean expressions using && (AND),\fP
\fI|| (OR) and ! (NOT). String values must be single\-quoted;\fP
\fInumeric values are unquoted. Unset optional fields (e.g. no\fP
\fIpreferred magnitude, typecertainty not set) are treated as null:\fP
\fI!= returns true, == returns false.\fP
**
\fISupported string keys: type, typecertainty,\fP
\fIevaluationstatus (alias: status), evaluationmode (alias: mode),\fP
\fIagencyid, author.\fP
**
\fISupported numeric keys: latitude (alias: lat),\fP
\fIlongitude (alias: lon), depth, magnitude (alias: mag),\fP
\fIrms, azimuthalgap (alias: gap).\fP
**
\fIString values use SeisComP enum names as\-is (lowercase with\fP
\fIspaces), e.g. \(aqearthquake\(aq, \(aqnot existing\(aq, \(aqquarry blast\(aq.\fP
**
\fIExample:\fP
\fIeventlist.highlight = auto, preliminary\fP
\fIeventlist.highlight.auto.condition = \(dqevaluationmode == \(aqautomatic\(aq\(dq\fP
\fIeventlist.highlight.auto.background = FF4100\fP
\fIeventlist.highlight.auto.foreground = 000000\fP
.UNINDENT
.UNINDENT
.INDENT 0.0
.TP
.B eventlist.highlight.highlight
Type: \fIlist:string\fP
.sp
Ordered list of highlight rule names. The first rule whose
condition matches the event is applied; subsequent rules are
not evaluated.
.UNINDENT
.sp
\fBNOTE:\fP
.INDENT 0.0
.INDENT 3.5
\fBeventlist.highlight.$name.*\fP
$name is a placeholder for the name to be used and needs to be added to \fBeventlist.highlight\fP to become active.
.INDENT 0.0
.INDENT 3.5
.sp
.nf
.ft C
eventlist.highlight = a,b
eventlist.highlight.a.value1 = ...
eventlist.highlight.b.value1 = ...
# c is not active because it has not been added
# to the list of eventlist.highlight
eventlist.highlight.c.value1 = ...
.ft P
.fi
.UNINDENT
.UNINDENT
.UNINDENT
.UNINDENT
.INDENT 0.0
.TP
.B eventlist.highlight.$name.condition
Type: \fIstring\fP
.sp
Logical expression evaluated against the event\(aqs preferred
origin, magnitude and event metadata. String values must
be single\-quoted. Use && for AND, || for OR, ! for NOT.
.UNINDENT
.INDENT 0.0
.TP
.B eventlist.highlight.$name.background
Type: \fIcolor\fP
.sp
Row background colour when this rule matches. Accepts a
6\-digit hex value (e.g. FFA500) or a Qt named colour
(e.g. yellow).
.UNINDENT
.INDENT 0.0
.TP
.B eventlist.highlight.$name.foreground
Type: \fIcolor\fP
.sp
Row foreground (text) colour when this rule matches.
Accepts a 6\-digit hex value or a Qt named colour.
.UNINDENT
.sp
